{"id": "EUVD-2026-99249", "enisaUuid": "b51607d2-135a-3995-ad6b-417162a613ab", "description": "Wukong AICRM through 20260610 contains a missing authorization vulnerability in the /systemConfig controller that allows any authenticated user to read the stored AI provider API key. Attackers can request GET /systemConfig/byType/ai for the cleartext key, or send a chosen apiUrl to /systemConfig/ai/test, forwarding the stored key to their host.", "datePublished": "2026-10-13T18:49:59", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-14T15:58:05", "baseScore": 7.1, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:H/VI:L/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://hackmd.io/@1ExmmukzRMWN7B4gQ4W-4Q/wukong-aicrm-api-wide-missing-authorization", "https://github.com/WuKongOpenSource/Wukong-AICRM/blob/20260610/backend/src/main/java/com/kakarote/ai_crm/service/impl/SystemConfigServiceImpl.java#L260-L294", "https://github.com/WuKongOpenSource/Wukong-AICRM/blob/20260610/backend/src/main/java/com/kakarote/ai_crm/service/impl/SystemConfigServiceImpl.java#L143-L155", "https://github.com/WuKongOpenSource/Wukong-AICRM/blob/20260610/backend/src/main/java/com/kakarote/ai_crm/service/impl/SystemConfigServiceImpl.java#L607-L619", "https://github.com/WuKongOpenSource/Wukong-AICRM/blob/20260610/backend/src/main/java/com/kakarote/ai_crm/controller/SystemConfigController.java#L53-L77", "https://github.com/WuKongOpenSource/Wukong-AICRM", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/wukong-aicrm-through-20260610-missing-authorization-in-system-configuration-apis-exposes-stored-ai-provider-keys"], "aliases": ["GHSA-xv88-5j3j-77rr", "CVE-2026-110208"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.39, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "10b240c8-120b-3582-be92-5d066cac24f0", "product": {"name": "Wukong AICRM", "vendor": {"name": "WuKongOpenSource"}}, "product_version": "0 \u226420260610"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "e7d4edd7-dc95-33ad-a146-96421fe43f7d", "vendor": {"name": "WuKongOpenSource"}}], "isExploited": f